 =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)^{′} \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{ln}^{2}⁡x-1}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{{ln}^{2}⁡x-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186516858 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166755 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eaab6e41-d34d-5eca-a41f-5ebe58a6b178" :knowledge-point/title "Differentiating an Inverse Cosh Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "179a74a5-b3d8-5e7a-9c3e-5819837efef1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6x}{\\sqrt{4{x}^{4}+1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516160} {:answer/id #uuid "31172cf1-3a3e-5cb6-afa8-4b91537a5882" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2x}{\\sqrt{4{x}^{4}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516215} {:answer/id #uuid "43ac0f87-1caa-5c8f-989a-102c5cc7de2c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{2{x}^{4}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516249} {:answer/id #uuid "a35fde23-056b-5940-8d9a-cc873ac086d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3x}{\\sqrt{2{x}^{2}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516450} {:answer/id #uuid "c55de174-20a2-5857-a097-babc7925bbfa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6x}{\\sqrt{4{x}^{4}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516531}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c55de174-20a2-5857-a097-babc7925bbfa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6x}{\\sqrt{4{x}^{4}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516531} :answer-field/id #uuid "ae6ae2c8-5130-53cc-bb64-372c2f7de751" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516733}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d4997d00-7652-5cc7-a200-60025211209a" :question/math-academy-id "q-95504" :question/problem "$$\n\nIf $y=\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡2{x}^{2},$ then $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosine function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above with the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡2{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡2{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{(2{x}^{2})}^{2}-1}}\\cdot {(2{x}^{2})}^{′} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4{x}^{4}-1}}\\cdot 4x \\\\  & =\\frac{6x}{\\sqrt{4{x}^{4}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186516844 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166756 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1979b91d-2ac0-5d35-b4cc-1c9c9505b503" :knowledge-point/title "Differentiating an Inverse Tanh Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0dac4121-cbe6-553e-bd16-6fab29fec507" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9{x}^{5}}{9-{x}^{12}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516143} {:answer/id #uuid "380efcee-b3e5-51ba-b34a-0999cc8d3601" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3{x}^{5}}{3-{x}^{12}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516228} {:answer/id #uuid "4f793398-fc2c-5c69-a5eb-7e3e8a2143ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{18{x}^{5}}{9-{x}^{12}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516275} {:answer/id #uuid "d0e05fce-5995-5a9b-8200-cbf720d49a94" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6{x}^{5}}{9-{x}^{6}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516554} {:answer/id #uuid "ffbcdb37-7a76-5a7a-b5f5-5c2b7570f9c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6{x}^{5}}{3-{x}^{6}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516648}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0dac4121-cbe6-553e-bd16-6fab29fec507" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9{x}^{5}}{9-{x}^{12}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516143} :answer-field/id #uuid "6744b580-35a3-5368-ab4c-1be0682aa649" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516696}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "bc18352d-fce3-5063-b58a-47ac19e5cf8d" :question/math-academy-id "q-95512" :question/problem "$$\n\nIf $y=\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{{x}^{6}}{3}),$ then $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic tangent function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above with the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{{x}^{6}}{3})) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{{x}^{6}}{3})) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{1-{(\\frac{{x}^{6}}{3})}^{2}}\\cdot {(\\frac{{x}^{6}}{3})}^{′} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{(1-\\frac{{x}^{12}}{9})}\\cdot 2{x}^{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{9{x}^{5}}{9-{x}^{12}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
